      "content": "thanks for that. regarding the sub-saharan africa part, can you be a bit more specific on why there's an issue with \"administrative maturity\"? is it a lack of trained personnel, or just a general cultural difference in how people approach professional responsibilities and organization compared to, say, the european models?",
